      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAPPY JOY (1) found the frame for the first time after five career runs last start when runner-up over 1720m at Dubbo, beaten 4 metres, after racing handy. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Meets some better types this time but another big run is on the cards. DARK MIRACLE (3) is back from a break of five months and looks to be right up to the mark following a placing in a recent trial. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Will have plenty of admirers. BROOKLYNS GEM (5) was unplaced two starts ago then things went wrong last start when she copped a check and broke, finishing 18 metres away in fourth over 1710m at Goulburn. If things go her way a top-three finish is on the cards. SHE SHIMMERS (7) is in the mix following a fourth at her most recent appearance over 1770m at this track.",
